---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'; import Button from '../components/Button.astro'; import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Find a Padel Game in Nairobi | Playtomic Kenya" description="Find open padel matches in Nairobi with Playtomic, understand your level or start with beginner coaching at Ace Padel."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Find a Game</div><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Nairobi padel</p><h1>Find a padel game in Nairobi.</h1><p class="lead">Use Playtomic for open matches. Use coaching when you are new, unsure of your level or ready to improve.</p></div></section><section class="section section--sand"><div class="container"><div class="card-grid"><article class="card"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Already use Playtomic?</h3><p>Open Playtomic and look for participating Nairobi clubs and open matches that fit your level.</p><Button href={site.playtomicUrl} variant="dark" external event="playtomic_click">Find a Game</Button></article><article class="card"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Don't know your level?</h3><p>Start with coaching focused on your technique, positioning, movement and match understanding.</p><Button href={site.bookingUrl} variant="dark" external event="book_coaching_click">Book Coaching</Button></article><article class="card"><span class="number">03</span><h3>New to padel?</h3><p>Learn the rules, court positions and core skills in a welcoming beginner session at Ace Padel.</p><Button href="/coaching/beginner-padel-coaching-nairobi" variant="dark">Beginner Coaching</Button></article></div></div></section><section class="accent-cta"><p class="eyebrow">One clear distinction</p><h2>Games on Playtomic. Coaching at Ace Padel.</h2><p>This site supports the local ecosystem; it does not recreate Playtomic matchmaking.</p></section></Layout>
